        "collapsible_row_y93qxH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "What is your return policy?",
            "icon": "return",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>For safety and product-integrity reasons, <strong>Parkmore nutritional supplements are non-returnable once shipped, whether opened or unopened</strong>. Because we cannot verify how supplements have been stored or handled after they leave our control, they cannot be restocked or resold.</p><p><strong>Non-supplement products</strong>, such as washes and topical creams, may be eligible for return within <strong>10 days of delivery</strong> if they are <strong>unused, unopened, and in their original packaging</strong>.</p><p><strong>Parkmore Magnetic Crowns are final sale and cannot be returned or refunded.</strong></p><p>If your order arrives <strong>damaged, incorrect, or defective</strong>, please contact us within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong> so we can make it right.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
            "button_label_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "/",
            "button_style_1": "primary",
            "button_style_1_show_arrow": false,
            "button_style_1_show_gradient_border": false,
            "button_1_border_gradient": "linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ttnbiT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "Do you offer refunds?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, in certain circumstances.</p><p><strong>Parkmore nutritional supplements are non-returnable and non-refundable once shipped</strong>, whether opened or unopened.</p><p>Unused, unopened <strong>non-supplement products</strong>, such as washes and topical creams, may be eligible for return within <strong>10 days of delivery</strong>. Once an approved return is received and inspected, any applicable refund will be issued.</p><p><strong>Parkmore Magnetic Crowns are final sale and cannot be returned or refunded.</strong></p><p>If your order arrives <strong>damaged, incorrect, or defective</strong>, please contact us within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>. We’ll review the issue and make it right with a replacement or refund when appropriate.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
            "button_label_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "/",
            "button_style_1": "primary",
            "button_style_1_show_arrow": false,
            "button_style_1_show_gradient_border": false,
            "button_1_border_gradient": "linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_i3Pjqc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "Can I change or cancel my order?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>Contact us <strong>as soon as possible</strong> after placing your order.</p><p>We process orders quickly, but we will gladly help with changes or cancellations <strong>as long as the order has not yet shipped</strong>.</p><p>Once an order has shipped, it can no longer be changed or canceled.</p><p>Please include your <strong>name and order number</strong> so we can locate your order quickly.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
            "button_label_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "/",
            "button_style_1": "primary",
            "button_style_1_show_arrow": false,
            "button_style_1_show_gradient_border": false,
            "button_1_border_gradient": "linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ejrwHK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "What if my order arrives damaged, incorrect, or missing an item?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>Please contact us within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>.</p><p>Include your <strong>name, order number, and a description of the problem</strong>. For damaged shipments, please also send clear photos of the packaging, shipping label, damaged product, and any product loss so we can document the issue properly.</p><p>For incorrect or incomplete shipments, photos of what you received may also be requested.</p><p>Once the issue is verified, we’ll work quickly to correct it with a replacement or refund when appropriate.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "content_embed": "",
            "button_text_size": "t3",
            "button_label_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "/",
            "button_style_1": "primary",
            "button_style_1_show_arrow": false,
            "button_style_1_show_gradient_border": false,
            "button_1_border_gradient": "linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"
