            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>Rush shipping may be available by special request.</p><p>If you need your order quickly, contact us <strong>before placing your order</strong> and we’ll let you know what options are available.</p><p>Additional shipping charges may apply.</p>",
