        "collapsible_row_KQVyBD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_open": false,
            "heading": "What if UPS says my package was delivered, but I can’t find it?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "image_width": 20,
            "row_heading_tag": "h3",
            "row_content": "<p>First, check around your property, including porches, side doors, garages, gates, barns, and other common delivery locations. It’s also worth checking with household members or nearby neighbors.</p><p>UPS may occasionally scan a package as delivered shortly before it is actually dropped off, so allow a little time for it to appear.</p><p>If you still cannot locate the package, contact us with your <strong>name, order number, and tracking number</strong> and we’ll help you determine the next step.</p>",
